Package: RStarStar
Type: Package
Title: Transpile Beginner-Friendly Source Files to R
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kisura", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "85266425+KisuraWSP@users.noreply.github.com"),
    person("RStarStar", role = "cph"))
Description: Compiles local '.rsspps' source files into readable R code without
    executing the input program. Supports checked bindings, vector expressions,
    CSV workflows, summaries, charts, and simple functions. Generated programs
    include their runtime checks and can be executed separately from compilation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, utils
SystemRequirements: Cairo support in R (optional, for PNG chart execution)
